  "semantic_review": {
    "terminology": "New 智能体/子智能体/后端/会话/对话/登录 agree with existing bytes; 会话=session, 对话=conversation. Existing 后台任务 means background jobs, not backend. No competing term introduced.",
    "notices": "All six preserve factual outcomes and schedule semantics; concise, no added politeness.",
    "run_details": "All sixteen compact technical messages preserve meaning, including unconfirmed cancellation, refusal without changes, session restart and repeated request.",
    "residue": "Only intentional OAuth, MCP, NAME, Aida and ICU technical identifiers remain; no untranslated English prose or bidi controls.",
    "probe_corrections": "Naive probes corrected: English repeats ::group-off across one/other, Chinese correctly has other only; 请求 means request, not politeness. Instance made lowercase to meet receipt validator."
  }
